sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Staff
    participant M as Main (CLI)
    participant BS as BillingService
    participant IS as InventoryService
    participant CS as CustomerService
    participant BR as BillRepository

    U->>M: Choose Billing, enter customer + items
    M->>BS: createBill(customerId, items, discount)
    BS->>CS: getCustomer(customerId)
    CS-->>BS: Customer
    loop for each requested item
        BS->>IS: getItem(itemId)
        IS-->>BS: JewelryItem
        BS->>BS: check stock >= quantity
    end
    BS->>IS: reduceStock(itemId, quantity) for each item
    BS->>BR: append(bill)
    BR-->>BS: saved
    BS-->>M: Bill
    M-->>U: Print invoice (subtotal, GST, total)
